### What the network library says when the meeting point cannot be reached.

failed-net-unreachable = 無法到達匯合點：{ $why }
failed-net-silent = 匯合點接受了連線，但 { $seconds } 秒內沒有應答
failed-net-broke-off = 匯合點的回應中斷了：{ $why }
failed-net-not-yet = 匯合點暫時不接受這個地址的下一條宣告：{ $said }
failed-net-full-for-today = 匯合點今天已收滿宣告：{ $said }
failed-net-refused-because = 匯合點回應 { $status }：{ $said }
failed-net-refused = 匯合點回應 { $status }
failed-net-statement-too-long = { $got } 位元組的宣告超過了公告板上限 { $longest }
failed-net-not-an-address = 匯合點沒有回應地址
